sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant K as kiko
    participant V as _validate_token
    participant M as _master_key()
    C->>K: request + Authorization / x-api-key / x-goog-api-key
    K->>V: token
    V->>M: read env MASTER_KEY
    M-->>V: key (or None)
    alt no MASTER_KEY configured
        V-->>C: 401 authentication_error
    else token matches
        V-->>K: OK
    else token mismatch
        V-->>C: 401 authentication_error
    end
